## Project Structure

# PROJECTSTRUCTURE: SagaSandbox

## Overview

Modular layout focused on **Timeline**, **per-card Whiteboard**, **ai-engine** (fal.ai), and **Exporter**. Legacy folders (Vault, Copilot, collaboration) may remain in the repo but are not part of the simplified product.

## Directory tree (target)

```
/src
├── /components
│   ├── /Timeline      # Card track UI
│   ├── /Whiteboard    # Per-card canvas + prompt
│   └── /Exporter      # Timeline video export UI
├── /hooks             # useTimeline, useFal, useCardWhiteboard
├── /services
│   ├── /ai-engine     # fal.ai Flux + video
│   └── /persistence   # Optional Supabase/Prisma
├── /lib
└── /types             # TimelineCard, WhiteboardState, Project
```

## Data flow

1. User edits timeline or whiteboard → local Zustand update.
2. Optional persist to DB/localStorage.
3. Generate → fal.ai → save URL on card → timeline thumbnail updates.
4. Export → bundle card assets → video job → MP4.

